ty engagement. Dates not specified.", "logo": "/assets/logo/research.jpeg"}, {"name": "weDevs Academy", "role": "Campus Ambassador", "description": "Student outreach, programme promotion and campus community engagement. Dates not specified.", "logo": "/assets/logo/research.jpeg"}, {"name": "WSDA New Zealand", "role": "Campus Ambassador — BPO Summit", "description": "Student outreach, programme promotion and campus community engagement. Dates not specified.", "logo": "/assets/logo/research.jpeg"}, {"name": "International Computer Science Competition (ICSC)", "role": "Campus Ambassador", "description": "Student outreach, programme promotion and campus community engagement. Dates not specified.", "logo": "/assets/logo/research.jpeg"}, {"name": "RUET CSE · Session 2020–2021", "role": "Class Representative", "description": "Class representative for RUET CSE, academic session 2020–2021.", "logo": "/assets/logo/research.jpeg"}, {"name": "3ZERO Leadership Challenge", "role": "Participant", "description": "Participated in the youth leadership initiative focused on zero poverty, zero unemployment and zero net carbon emissions.", "logo": "/assets/logo/research.jpeg"}]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT(content_key) DO NOTHING;
